WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.037
What did the posting ask for?

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:07.425
Which story answers that question?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.020
Open an application's Details, and press Practise.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.625
The prep sheet opens.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.113
Each ask in the posting sits next to the closest line on your resume.

00:00:29.113 --> 00:00:32.050
Where nothing is close, it says so plainly.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.123
A mock interview asks one question at a time,

00:00:37.123 --> 00:00:40.155
and the answers you save come back on the sheet.
